 1506                   ; Read one 256 byte sector from disk.
 1507                   ; Return a 00h in A if the operation completes properly, and 01h if an error occurs during the read.
 1508                   ; Disk number in DBANK  (4..7)
 1509                   ; Track number in IOT
 1510                   ; Sector number in IOS
 1511                   ; DMA address in IOD
 1512                   
 1513         0000      	IF NOT NEWIDE
 1632                   	ENDIF		; NEWIDE
 1633                   	
